      "content": "Use a long-shaft small flat-blade screwdriver to release the upper tab."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_3966",
      "reading_order": 5440,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 470.42,
        "r": 532.8700000000002,
        "b": 446.83
      },
      "content": "With the tabs disengaged the front of the cover is released. Rotate the front of the cover away from the printer (callout 1) to release the rear of the cover (callout 2), and then remove it."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_3967",
      "reading_order": 5441,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.0,
        "t": 196.54999999999995,
        "r": 344.72000000000014,
        "b": 184.96000000000004
      },
      "content": "Remove the top-left cover (M527/E52545M528/E52645)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_3968",
      "reading_order": 5442,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 112.99996,
        "t": 175.54999999999995,
        "r": 541.5999600000005,
        "b": 151.96000000000004
      },
      "content": "Open the toner-cartridge door, release two tabs (callout 1), and then rotate the rear edge of the cover away from the printer."
    },
